        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents Decorative Nantucket Push Plate 3-3/4\" Wide x 13-7/8\" High\r\n</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis decorative Nantucket push plate is from the new Brass Accents Renaissance Collection. Highly detailed genuine recreation of the popular Roman style original from Russell & Erwin Hardware, 1909. The decorative design push plate was very popular in churches and high end homes in europe. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBrass Accents provides distinctive craftsmanship with old-world tradition for a lifetime of elegance, hand finished in the USA. They are one of the worlds leading crafters of decorative hot-forged  and cast brass door hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <b>Matching <a href=\"/products/nantucket-solid-brass-pull-plate-brass-accents-a04-p7201\">Decorative Nantucket Pull Plate</a>\r\n</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for  Brass Accents A04-P7200 Decorative Nantucket Push Plate\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 13-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Brass</li>\r\n<li><b>Finish Warranty: 10 Years</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nComes complete with matching finish mounting screws for easy installation. Hand rubbed and finished in the USA with a 10 year warranty.\r\n</p>",
